# A [[system]] for [[verify]]ing that the bearer of a [[debit card]] or [[credit card]] is the owner, involving cards that contain a [[silicon chip]] storing the PIN of the card; the bearer confirms ownership of the card by inserting it into a machine and entering the PIN, which is compared with the one stored on the chip.

